<section>
  <p>Mane does not currently maintain a separate server-side account database. If you sign in with Google, basic account information may be stored locally on your device so the app can recognize your signed-in state and premium access.</p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Removing data</h2>
  <p>To remove your local Mane data, uninstall the app or clear the app data from your Android device settings. This removes saved words, learning progress, recent searches, settings, and locally stored sign-in state.</p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Purchases</h2>
  <p>Google Play purchases and subscriptions are managed by Google Play and may be retained according to Google’s policies.</p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>If you need help with account deletion, email <a href="mailto:{{ site.supportEmail }}">{{ site.supportEmail }}</a>.</p>
</section>
